<footer class="footer" id="contacto">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
            <img src="/angologo512.png" alt="ANGO Metalurgica" class="footer-logo">
            <p>Fabricaci&oacute;n y comercializaci&oacute;n de tomas de fuerza con embrague. Ingenier&iacute;a que transmite potencia.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-map-column">
            <a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=-32.187504848958156,-64.13085718142419" target="_blank" class="footer-map-container" style="display: block; position: relative; height: 180px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: #e0e0e0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://maps.google.com/maps?ll=-32.187504848958156,-64.13085718142419&z=15&output=embed"
                    width="100%" 
                    height="100%" 
                    style="border:0; filter: grayscale(100%); opacity: 0.85; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;" 
                    allowfullscreen="" 
                    loading="lazy" 
                    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
                </iframe>
                <!-- Pin personalizado ANGO -->
                <div class="custom-map-pin" style="position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -100%); z-index: 2;">
                    <i class="ph-fill ph-map-pin" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 40px; filter: drop-shadow(0px 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));"></i>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>Contacto</h3>
            <p><i class="ph ph-map-pin"></i> Franklin 1153 - Parque Industrial Leonardo Davinci<br>
            <span style="margin-left: 24px;">CP 5850 - R&iacute;o Tercero - C&oacute;rdoba, Argentina</span></p>
            <p><i class="ph ph-phone"></i> +54 9 3571 699006</p>
            <p><i class="ph ph-envelope"></i> contacto@angometalurgica.com.ar</p>
            <p><i class="ph ph-globe"></i> www.angometalurgica.com.ar</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
